  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 06_Chapter6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_06
  storyName: War Never Misses a Fight
  storyDescription: 'Battle: Warlock, Noz and Bokusu vs. Tren, Trady and Cashino.
    Learn counters, perfect switches and the Annihilator.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 6
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5d3618b71b7cc23e299055b24f810ab1, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 0}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The group continues their journey.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar has learned how to attack, switch characters, and protect himself
        from incoming projectiles. But his previous encounters have shown him that
        simply surviving isn't enough.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He needs to understand how Concept Spirits interact with one another.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Noz, there's something I've been wondering.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What is it, Your Majesty?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Why are some opponents so much harder to defeat than others?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Their conceptual hierarchies can influence the outcome of a battle.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hierarchies?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: There are several classifications used in Concept Clash. Some concepts
        have advantages over others.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So it's like type advantages?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: In a simplified sense, yes.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: BASICALLY, PICK THE RIGHT ONE AND HIT HARDER!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's a rather simplified explanation, but not entirely wrong.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Can you give me an example?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Abstract concepts have an advantage over Simple concepts. Simple concepts
        have an advantage over Special concepts. Special concepts have an advantage
        over Abstract concepts.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So there's a cycle?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Precisely.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That means choosing the right character can make a significant difference.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I should've known that before fighting Tren and Trady.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: It is something you will need to remember.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEY! YOU GUYS FIGHTING?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Yes?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NICE. I'M IN.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: "Wait, that's not\u2014"
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: TOO LATE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Who is that?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Warlock. The concept of War.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU LOOK LIKE YOU COULD USE SOMEONE WHO KNOWS HOW TO FIGHT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you going to help us?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'M GOING TO HAVE FUN!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is not quite the same thing.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: SO WHO ARE WE FIGHTING?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We haven't decided yet.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEN LET'S FIND SOMEONE!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A familiar group appears.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh? It's you again.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: My, my. You brought someone new.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OHHH!!! LOOKS LIKE WE HAVE MORE CUSTOMERS!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Please don't call them customers before they've spent anything.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEY MIGHT HAVE MONEY!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Who's that?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: My younger sister. Cashino.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HELLO!!! I'M CASHINO!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are we fighting again?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NOW YOU'RE TALKING!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I have a bad feeling about this.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty, remember the hierarchy advantages we discussed.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And remember to use the right character for the right situation.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: LET'S GET STARTED!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    level: {fileID: 0}
